    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Talbot are delighted to bring to the market this three-bedroom semi-detached bungalow, located within walking distance of Nenagh town centre.\n\nThe property extends to approximately 105 sq. m. and comprises entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, three bedrooms, bathroom, shower room, utility room and walk-in wardrobe.\n\nThe kitchen/dining area is a good-sized room with access to the rear, while the living room is positioned to the front of the property. There are three bedrooms, along with a bathroom and separate shower room.\n\nExternally, the property has a large gravelled front area providing ample off-street parking.\n\nLocated close to Nenagh town centre, the property is within easy reach of local shops, schools, services and amenities.\n\nThe property offers good potential for those looking for a bungalow in a convenient town location.\n\nViewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.47m x 1.12m\ntimber flooring, bay window, solid fuel stove and panelling\n\nLiving Room - 3.94m x 3.46m\ntimber flooring and panelling\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 6.5m x 3.17m\nfitted kitchen units, electric oven and hob, sliding door to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 4.08m x 1.65m\nfitted units and plumbing for washing machine\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.77m x 2.68m\nbuilt in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.06m x 2.78m\ntimber flooring and built in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.75m x 3.17m\ntimber flooring and built in wardrobes\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 2.36m x 1.93m\ntimber flooring\n\nShower Room - 1.88m x 1.69m\ntiled, wc, handbasin and electric shower\n\nBathroom - 2.75m x 2.59m\ntiled, wc, handbasin, bath and panelling\n\nHallway - 3.19m x 0.93m\ntimber flooring and panelling\n\n"
      },
